IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q23-DUPLICATE-DETECTOR.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N PIC 9(4).
01 WS-I PIC 9(4).
01 WS-J PIC 9(4).
01 WS-ID-TABLE.
   05 WS-ID OCCURS 1000 TIMES PIC X(20).
01 WS-DUPLICATE PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-FOUND PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-N
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-N
        ACCEPT WS-ID(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-N
        MOVE 'N' TO WS-FOUND
        PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM WS-I BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > WS-N
            IF WS-J > WS-I
                IF WS-ID(WS-I) = WS-ID(WS-J)
                    MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FOUND
                END-IF
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
        IF WS-FOUND = 'Y'
            DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ID(WS-I))
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-DUPLICATE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-DUPLICATE = 'N' DISPLAY "NO DUPLICATES" END-IF
    STOP RUN.
